secubox-magicmirror (1.1.1-1~bookworm1) bookworm; urgency=medium

  * Phase 7 (#498) fix : debian/rules now installs api/routers/
    (__init__.py + mmpm.py) — previous version shipped only api/main.py
    and an empty __init__.py, so 'from .routers import mmpm' always
    failed at import time. Pre-existing bug uncovered by aggregator
    consolidation.

